<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria, Japan Tobacco Explore Breakup of Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>尼日利亚增加美元零售供应以抑制奈拉波动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/nigeria-boosts-retail-supply-of-dollars-to-curb-naira-volatility</link><description>尼日利亚中央银行批准大幅增加向零售客户出售美元，以寻求增加当地流动性并缓解本月下跌的奈拉的压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/nigeria-boosts-retail-supply-of-dollars-to-curb-naira-volatility'&gt;尼日利亚增加美元零售供应以抑制奈拉波动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nigeria Boosts Retail Supply of Dollars to Curb Naira Volatility&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/nigeria-boosts-retail-supply-of-dollars-to-curb-naira-volatility</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:29:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英国是最新报告柴油需求下滑的欧洲大型经济体</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-is-latest-big-european-economy-to-report-diesel-demand-slump</link><description>英国是最新一个报告柴油销售因中东和乌克兰冲突引发的天价高价而陷入困境的欧洲主要国家。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-is-latest-big-european-economy-to-report-diesel-demand-slump'&gt;英国是最新报告柴油需求下滑的欧洲大型经济体&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UK Is Latest Big European Economy to Report Diesel Demand Slump&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-is-latest-big-european-economy-to-report-diesel-demand-slump</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:51:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>西班牙德科斯将接替拉加德担任欧洲央行行长（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/spain-s-de-cos-set-to-succeed-lagarde-as-ecb-president-video-mwxmko5n</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/spain-s-de-cos-set-to-succeed-lagarde-as-ecb-president-video-mwxmko5n'&gt;西班牙德科斯将接替拉加德担任欧洲央行行长（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Spain's De Cos Set to Succeed Lagarde as ECB President (Video)&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/spain-s-de-cos-set-to-succeed-lagarde-as-ecb